Aerie-Purpose: Say Aerie, not Helium, in the flag names and descriptions on the flags page and in the page text that the Web Store fixup rewrites.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/helium_flag_entries.h, components/extstore_fixups/chrome-webstore.js
Aerie-Kind: branding

Both files are Helium's own and are not string files, so the Helium to Aerie
name pass (tools/aerie_build/substitution.py) does not reach them. Only
string literals change; the flag ids and C++ identifiers keep their names.

